    "teach_3": {
      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Swapping the upstream and downstream distances creates another common exam shape.\n\nSuppose 24 km upstream + 36 km downstream takes 6 h.\nAnd 36 km upstream + 24 km downstream takes 6.5 h.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_3_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_3_step": {
      "id": "teach_3_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "These are:\n24/U + 36/D = 6\n36/U + 24/D = 6.5.\n\nThey solve to U=8 and D=12 km/hr.\nSo still water = 10 and current = 2 km/hr.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_3"
        }
      ]
    },
